<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ELMER AD S.A  DE C.V - Impulsando tu marca hacia el futuro digital.</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Open+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-primary: #c026d3;
            --color-secondary: #06b6d4;
            --color-bg: #09090b;
            --color-card-bg: #18181b;
            --color-text: #fafafa;
            --color-header: #18181b;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--color-bg);
            color: var(--color-text);
        }
        .preview-font-heading {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    
                    
                    <!-- ANNOUNCEMENT BAR -->
                    <div id="prev-announcement-bar" class="py-2 px-4 text-center text-xs font-bold text-white transition flex justify-between items-center" style="background-color: var(--color-primary); display: flex;">
                        <span class="flex-1 text-center" id="prev-announcement-text"></span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- NAVBAR CON LOGO Y NOMBRE -->
                    <header id="preview-header" class="sticky top-0 z-30 px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center shadow-sm theme-transition" style="background-color: var(--color-header);">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                            <img id="prev-brand-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Logo" class="h-9 w-auto object-contain">
                            <span class="preview-font-heading text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight" id="prev-brand-name" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">ELMER AD S.A  DE C.V</span>
                        </div>
                        <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-6 text-sm font-medium opacity-80">
                            <a href="#catalogo" class="hover:opacity-100 transition">Productos</a>
                            <a href="#video-sec" class="hover:opacity-100 transition">Video</a>
                            <a href="#faq-sec" class="hover:opacity-100 transition">Preguntas</a>
                        </nav>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <a id="prev-contact-email-btn" href="mailto:elmerjsortor@gmail.com" class="hidden sm:inline-flex px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold border border-current opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition items-center gap-1">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Contacto
                            </a>
                            <a id="prev-nav-cta" href="#catalogo" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition transform hover:scale-105" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);">
                                Ver Catálogo
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </header>

                    <!-- HERO BANNER / PORTADA -->
                    <section id="prev-hero-sec" class="relative min-h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center text-center p-8 overflow-hidden">
                        <div id="prev-hero-bg-container" class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550745165-9bc0b252726f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80" class="w-full h-full object-cover"></div>
                        <div id="prev-hero-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black z-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300" style="opacity: 0.65;"></div>
                        
                        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white py-12">
                            <h1 id="prev-hero-title" class="preview-font-heading text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight drop-shadow-md" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Impulsando tu marca hacia el futuro digital.</h1>
                            <p id="prev-hero-subtitle" class="text-base sm:text-xl font-normal opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed drop-shadow"></p>
                            <div class="pt-4 flex justify-center space-x-4">
                                <a id="prev-hero-cta" href="#catalogo" class="px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl text-base font-bold text-white shadow-xl transition transform hover:scale-105 inline-block" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);">Explorar Productos</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- SECCIÓN DE PRODUCTOS (GRID CON DETALLES AL HACER CLIC) -->
                    <section id="prev-catalog-sec" class="py-20 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto" style="display: block;">
                        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
                            <h2 id="prev-catalog-title" class="preview-font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Nuestros Servicios</h2>
                            <div class="w-16 h-1.5 rounded-full mx-auto" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);"></div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="prev-products-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-black/5 flex flex-col justify-between transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 cursor-pointer" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-video bg-slate-100">
                        <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">🔥</span>
                        <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Redes Sociales y Contenido" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <h3 class="preview-font-heading text-xl font-bold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Redes Sociales y Contenido</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs opacity-80 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">Social Media Management: Creación de contenido, calendarización y gestión de comunidades en redes sociales.

Marketing de Contenidos: Redacción de blogs, eBooks, guías y producción audiovisual (video marketing) para educar y conectar con la audiencia.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="preview-font-heading text-2xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">$150</span>
                            <button onclick="event.stopPropagation(); openCheckoutModal(0)" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-white shadow transition hover:opacity-90" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);">Comprar Ahora</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div><div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-black/5 flex flex-col justify-between transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 cursor-pointer" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-video bg-slate-100">
                        <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">Oferta -20%</span>
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523275335684-37898b6baf30?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80" alt="Smartwatch Sport Edition" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <h3 class="preview-font-heading text-xl font-bold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Smartwatch Sport Edition</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs opacity-80 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">Monitor cardíaco, sensor GPS integrado y resistencia al agua hasta 50 metros.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="preview-font-heading text-2xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">$199.99</span>
                            <button onclick="event.stopPropagation(); openCheckoutModal(1)" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-white shadow transition hover:opacity-90" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);">Comprar Ahora</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div><div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-black/5 flex flex-col justify-between transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 cursor-pointer" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-video bg-slate-100">
                        <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">Nuevo</span>
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608043152269-423dbba4e7e1?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80" alt="Altavoz Bluetooth Portátil" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 space-y-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <h3 class="preview-font-heading text-xl font-bold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Altavoz Bluetooth Portátil</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs opacity-80 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">Sonido envolvente 360 grados, graves profundos y diseño a prueba de agua IPX7.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="preview-font-heading text-2xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">$89.99</span>
                            <button onclick="event.stopPropagation(); openCheckoutModal(2)" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-white shadow transition hover:opacity-90" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);">Comprar Ahora</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div></div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- SECCIÓN DE VIDEO -->
                    <section id="prev-video-sec" class="py-20 px-6 bg-black/5" style="display: none;">
                        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-center">
                            <h2 id="prev-video-sec-title" class="preview-font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Conoce Nuestro Producto en Acción</h2>
                            <div id="prev-video-wrapper" class="aspect-video w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-black/10 bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center"><iframe class="w-full h-full" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- SECCIÓN PREGUNTAS FRECUENTES -->
                    <section id="prev-faq-sec" class="py-20 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto" style="display: block;">
                        <div class="text-center mb-12 space-y-3">
                            <h2 class="preview-font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Preguntas Frecuentes</h2>
                            <p class="text-sm opacity-75">Resuelve tus dudas antes de realizar tu compra</p>
                        </div>
                        <div id="prev-faq-container" class="space-y-4"><div class="rounded-xl border border-black/5 overflow-hidden shadow-sm" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <details class="group p-4">
                        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-sm cursor-pointer list-none preview-font-heading" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">
                            <span>¿Cuánto tarda el envío?</span>
                            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs"></i></span>
                        </summary>
                        <p class="text-xs opacity-80 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-black/5 pt-3">Los envíos estándar tardan entre 24 y 48 horas hábiles según tu ubicación.</p>
                    </details>
                </div><div class="rounded-xl border border-black/5 overflow-hidden shadow-sm" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <details class="group p-4">
                        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-sm cursor-pointer list-none preview-font-heading" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">
                            <span>¿Los productos tienen garantía?</span>
                            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs"></i></span>
                        </summary>
                        <p class="text-xs opacity-80 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-black/5 pt-3">Sí, todos nuestros productos cuentan con 12 meses de garantía oficial directa.</p>
                    </details>
                </div><div class="rounded-xl border border-black/5 overflow-hidden shadow-sm" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <details class="group p-4">
                        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-sm cursor-pointer list-none preview-font-heading" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">
                            <span>¿El sitio web incluye el diseño adaptado para dispositivos móviles?</span>
                            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-xs"></i></span>
                        </summary>
                        <p class="text-xs opacity-80 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-black/5 pt-3">Sí, 100%. Todas nuestras páginas están optimizadas para verse y funcionar a la perfección en celulares, tabletas y computadoras</p>
                    </details>
                </div></div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- SECCIÓN RESEÑAS -->
                    <section id="prev-reviews-sec" class="py-20 px-6 bg-black/5" style="display: block;">
                        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-12">
                            <div class="text-center space-y-3">
                                <h2 class="preview-font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2>
                                <p class="text-sm opacity-75">Opiniones reales de usuarios satisfechos</p>
                            </div>
                            <div id="prev-reviews-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-black/5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
                        <p class="text-xs italic opacity-90 leading-relaxed">"Compré los auriculares y llegaron en menos de 24 horas. La calidad del empaque y del producto es insuperable."</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 pt-2">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535713875002-d1d0cf377fde?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=150&amp;q=80" alt="Mateo Benítez" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-black/10">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="preview-font-heading text-xs font-bold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Mateo Benítez</h4>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-semibold">✔ Cliente Verificado</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-black/5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4" style="background-color: var(--color-card-bg);">
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-amber-400 text-sm">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
                        <p class="text-xs italic opacity-90 leading-relaxed">"Excelente atención al cliente. Tuve una consulta sobre el envío y me respondieron por WhatsApp de inmediato."</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 pt-2">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=150&amp;q=80" alt="Sofia Ramos" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-black/10">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="preview-font-heading text-xs font-bold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">Sofia Ramos</h4>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-semibold">✔ Cliente Verificado</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- FOOTER -->
                    <footer id="preview-footer" class="py-12 px-6 border-t border-black/10 opacity-90">
                        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-sm">
                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <h3 id="prev-footer-brand" class="preview-font-heading text-xl font-bold" style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">ELMER AD S.A  DE C.V</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs opacity-75 leading-relaxed">Ofrecemos productos de calidad superior con garantía directa y atención personalizada.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="space-y-2">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider opacity-60">Contacto Directo</h4>
                                <p class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope opacity-70"></i> <span id="prev-footer-email">elmerjsortor@gmail.com</span></p>
                                <p class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone opacity-70"></i> <span id="prev-footer-phone">+503 7888-7044</span></p>
                                <p class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot opacity-70"></i> <span id="prev-footer-address">SANTA ROSA DE LIMA, LA UNIÓN NORTE, EL SALVADOR</span></p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider opacity-60">Redes Sociales</h4>
                                <div class="flex space-x-3 text-lg">
                                    <a id="prev-social-fb" href="#" class="hover:opacity-100 opacity-70"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook"></i></a>
                                    <a id="prev-social-ig" href="#" class="hover:opacity-100 opacity-70"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                                    <a id="prev-social-wa" href="https://wa.me/50378887044" class="hover:opacity-100 opacity-70"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-black/5 text-center text-xs opacity-50">
                            © <span id="prev-year">2026</span> Todos los derechos reservados.
                        </div>
                    </footer>

                
</body>
</html>
